      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 1846833183091735543, guid: 5aa8f79cd6416fd4ea3f09ac4a61ebc3, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'This shader supports the Camera Transparent Texture, which lets you
        see transparent objects in the screen texture.


        To use it, you need
        to:

        - Add the Camera Transparent Texture feature to your Renderer
        Data''s Renderer Feature list

        - Add your bubble object to a new
        layer

        - Remove the layer from your Renderer Data''s Transparent
        Layer Mask

        - Add a Render Objects feature to the Renderer Data Renderer
        Features list

        - Set the Event of the Render Objects to AfterRenderingTransparents,
        set the Queue to Transparent, and set the Layer Mask to only your special
        layer'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
